{"id":"1977519609759547471","url":"https://x.com/aserquis/status/1977519609759547471","card":null,"lang":"es","text":"Con el RIGI vigente, la inversión de OpenAI pareciera ser lisa y llanamente una entrega de nuestros bienes comunes a cambio de un par de dólares. Es verdad que puede generar trabajo para argentinos mientras se construyan los Data Center, pero después de haberse construido habrá sólo un puñado de puestos laborales fijos. Mientras tanto, Argentina no desarrolla tecnología propia y no genera un rédito económico a largo plazo.","type":"tweet","place":{"id":"4e51dcd7e0471448","name":"Río Negro","country":"Argentina","full_name":"Río Negro, Argentina","place_type":"admin","country_code":"AR","bounding_box_polygon":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]}},"author":{"id":"3066001030","url":"https://x.com/aserquis","name":"Adriana Cristina Serquis","type":"user","canDm":false,"status":"","entities":{"url":{},"description":{"urls":[]}},"location":"Argentina","userName":"aserquis","createdAt":"Mon Mar 02 11:31:09 +0000 2015","followers":6107,"following":263,"isVerified":false,"mediaCount":980,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/aserquis","automatedBy":null,"canMediaTag":true,"description":"","isAutomated":false,"profile_bio":{"entities":{"url":{"urls":[{"url":"https://t.co/g8QaMqCqEB","indices":[0,23],"display_url":"unrn.edu.ar/home","expanded_url":"https://www.unrn.edu.ar/home"}]},"description":{}},"description":"Diputada Nacional por Fuerza Patria Río Negro. Doctora en Física e investigadora. Ex-Presidenta de CNEA."},"coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3066001030/1743541701","isTranslator":false,"verifiedType":null,"statusesCount":2539,"isBlueVerified":true,"pinnedTweetIds":[],"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1959045324082692096/mzol3HQM_normal.jpg","favouritesCount":1861,"possiblySensitive":false,"fastFollowersCount":0,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{}},"source":"Twitter for iPhone","article":null,"isReply":false,"entities":{"urls":[],"symbols":[],"hashtags":[],"user_mentions":[]},"createdAt":"Sun Oct 12 23:39:50 +0000 2025","likeCount":140,"viewCount":19545,"quoteCount":25,"replyCount":92,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/aserquis/status/1977519609759547471","inReplyToId":null,"quoted_tweet":{"id":"1976678630534119819","url":"https://x.com/OPRArgentina/status/1976678630534119819","card":null,"lang":"es","text":"El Presidente Javier Milei recibió en Casa Rosada, junto a Demian Reidel, a representantes de OpenAI, quienes le anunciaron el lanzamiento de Stargate Argentina, un proyecto pionero de infraestructura de Inteligencia Artificial que situará a la Argentina a la vanguardia del ecosistema global de inteligencia artificial. 

En este marco, OpenAI y Sur Energy firmaron una Carta de Intención para colaborar en un proyecto de Data Center a gran escala capaz de albergar la próxima generación de computación de IA y alcanzar una capacidad de hasta 500 MW. 

Estructurado en el marco de RIGI, el proyecto supondrá una inversión de hasta 25.000 millones de dólares a gran escala, lo que lo posiciona como una de las mayores iniciativas de tecnología e infraestructura energética en la historia de Argentina.","type":"tweet","place":{},"author":{"id":"1726688083062439936","url":"https://x.com/OPRArgentina","name":"Oficina del Presidente","type":"user","canDm":false,"status":"","entities":{"url":{},"description":{"urls":[]}},"location":"Argentina","userName":"OPRArgentina","createdAt":"Mon Nov 20 19:45:04 +0000 2023","followers":505689,"following":2,"isVerified":false,"mediaCount":1066,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/OPRArgentina","automatedBy":null,"canMediaTag":true,"description":"","isAutomated":false,"profile_bio":{"entities":{"description":{}},"description":"Oficina del Presidente de la República Argentina, Javier Gerardo Milei"},"coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1726688083062439936/1704744058","isTranslator":false,"verifiedType":"Government","statusesCount":1181,"isBlueVerified":true,"pinnedTweetIds":[],"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1794456403832082432/e0Rdzzoe_normal.jpg","favouritesCount":6,"possiblySensitive":false,"fastFollowersCount":0,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{}},"source":"Twitter for iPhone","article":null,"isReply":false,"entities":{"urls":[],"symbols":[],"hashtags":[],"user_mentions":[]},"createdAt":"Fri Oct 10 15:58:05 +0000 2025","likeCount":10404,"viewCount":1236116,"quoteCount":289,"replyCount":457,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/OPRArgentina/status/1976678630534119819","inReplyToId":null,"quoted_tweet":null,"retweetCount":1875,"bookmarkCount":248,"communityInfo":null,"conversationId":"1976678630534119819","isLimitedReply":false,"inReplyToUserId":null,"retweeted_tweet":null,"displayTextRange":[0,274],"extendedEntities":{"media":[{"url":"https://t.co/IAKGaSyxC7","type":"photo","sizes":{"large":{"h":1365,"w":2