{"id":"1989441376228962814","url":"https://x.com/Willy_Covernton/status/1989441376228962814","card":null,"lang":"es","text":"SE VAN A LA PATAGONIA, PARA NO TENER QUE COMPRARLE ELECTRICIDAD A LA EPE...

"MILEI: LA IA ABIERTA CONVERTIRÁ A ARGENTINA EN UN HUB GLOBAL DE IA  "La inversión que OpenAI realizará en Argentina [25 mil millones de dólares] no es poca cosa. Van a convertir a Argentina en un centro mundial para la IA."  Una de las ventajas que ofrece Argentina es la energía barata y las bajas temperaturas. Esto reduce sustancialmente los costos operativos de los centros de datos.  -Presidente Javier Milei  @JMilei"","type":"tweet","place":{},"author":{"id":"833220775","url":"https://x.com/Willy_Covernton","name":"Guillermo L Covernton","type":"user","canDm":false,"status":"","entities":{"url":{},"description":{"urls":[]}},"location":"","userName":"Willy_Covernton","createdAt":"Wed Sep 19 12:27:10 +0000 2012","followers":7238,"following":1062,"isVerified":false,"mediaCount":4675,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/Willy_Covernton","automatedBy":null,"canMediaTag":false,"description":"","isAutomated":false,"profile_bio":{"entities":{"description":{}},"description":"Es Doctor en Economía. Prof. Macroeconomía, Finanzas Públicas, Econ. Argentina, Emprendimiento de Negocios y Cadenas de Valor en UCA. Es consultor y empresario."},"coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/833220775/1410306374","isTranslator":false,"verifiedType":null,"statusesCount":81897,"isBlueVerified":true,"pinnedTweetIds":["1728080251383587162"],"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/485174090571870208/g33BEkiT_normal.jpeg","favouritesCount":2134,"possiblySensitive":false,"fastFollowersCount":0,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{}},"source":"Twitter for iPhone","article":null,"isReply":false,"entities":{"urls":[],"symbols":[],"hashtags":[],"user_mentions":[{"name":"Javier Milei","id_str":"4020276615","indices":[493,500],"screen_name":"JMilei"}]},"createdAt":"Fri Nov 14 21:12:40 +0000 2025","likeCount":2,"viewCount":195,"quoteCount":0,"replyCount":0,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/Willy_Covernton/status/1989441376228962814","inReplyToId":null,"quoted_tweet":{"id":"1989335436964020549","url":"https://x.com/ArgMilei/status/1989335436964020549","card":null,"lang":"en","text":"MILEI: OPEN-AI WILL TURN ARGENTINA INTO A GLOBAL AI HUB

"The investment that OpenAI will make in Argentina [$25 billion] is no small thing. They are going to turn Argentina into a global hub for AI.

One of the things Argentina has to offer is cheap energy and low temperatures. These lower substantially data centers operating costs."

-President Javier Milei
