{"id":"2093124549495705861","url":"https://x.com/Ambitocom/status/2093124549495705861","card":null,"lang":"es","text":"LANZAN 18 NUEVOS CEDEARS DE ACCIONES Y ETFS VINCULADOS A IA, ENERGÍA, FINANZAS, REAL STATE Y COMMODITIES

La oferta de Cedears vuelve a ampliarse con una nueva tanda de instrumentos que permitirá a los inversores argentinos acceder a 13 compañías internacionales y cinco ETF, con una fuerte presencia de empresas vinculadas con la inteligencia artificial, semiconductores, centros de datos y generación eléctrica.

La incorporación anunciada por Banco Comafi también suma alternativas en servicios financieros, real estate, industria y salud, además de fondos que permiten diversificar la cartera hacia Canadá, Asia-Pacífico y commodities. Entre las compañías aparecen nombres como GE Vernova, Talen Energy, KLA, Dell Technologies, Western Digital, Morgan Stanley, Interactive Brokers y SK Hynix.","type":"tweet","place":{},"author":{"id":"65463088","url":"https://x.com/Ambitocom","name":"Ámbito Financiero","type":"user","canDm":true,"status":"","entities":{"url":{},"description":{"urls":[]}},"location":"","userName":"Ambitocom","createdAt":"Thu Aug 13 20:45:39 +0000 2009","followers":287501,"following":63,"isVerified":false,"mediaCount":134981,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/Ambitocom","automatedBy":null,"canMediaTag":true,"description":"","isAutomated":false,"profile_bio":{"entities":{"url":{"urls":[{"url":"https://t.co/MjKgzZACmI","indices":[0,23],"display_url":"ambito.com","expanded_url":"http://www.ambito.com"}]},"description":{"hashtags":[{"text":"economía","indices":[22,31]},{"text":"finanzas","indices":[34,43]}]}},"description":"Toda la actualidad de #economía y #finanzas en Argentina y el mundo. El valor de la información."},"coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/65463088/1770042226","isTranslator":false,"verifiedType":null,"statusesCount":533003,"isBlueVerified":true,"pinnedTweetIds":["2102109167762694245"],"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2018329490867277827/qKk2n0r1_normal.png","favouritesCount":6,"possiblySensitive":false,"fastFollowersCount":0,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{}},"source":"Twitter for iPhone","article":null,"isReply":false,"entities":{"urls":[],"symbols":[],"hashtags":[],"user_mentions":[]},"createdAt":"Thu Aug 27 23:52:35 +0000 2026","likeCount":8,"viewCount":2885,"quoteCount":0,"replyCount":2,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/Ambitocom/status/2093124549495705861","inR