{"id":"2095957680552583410","url":"https://x.com/fededomin/status/2095957680552583410","card":null,"lang":"es","text":"En términos industriales, la ventaja de Argentina como gran productor de gas puede ser enorme. Tenemos precios energéticos comparables con USA, mientras Europa y Asia enfrentan precios hasta ocho veces superiores.

Argentina puede competir con una matriz energética similar a la de USA y atraer industrias intensivas en energía: petroquímica, fertilizantes, aluminio, data centers, hidrógeno verde y urea. Muy importante esto RIGI y aprobar Súper RIGI. 

En un mundo de crecientes tensiones geopolíticas y riesgos sobre las cadenas de suministro, contar además con seguridad energética y poco riesgo de interrupción de nuestras exportaciones multiplica esa ventaja. Gráfico @Econometrica","type":"tweet","place":{},"author":{"id":"148579545","url":"https://x.com/fededomin","name":"Federico Dominguez","type":"user","canDm":true,"status":"","entities":{"url":{},"description":{"urls":[]}},"location":"Ciudad Autónoma de Buenos Aire","userName":"fededomin","createdAt":"Thu May 27 02:15:23 +0000 2010","followers":30631,"following":1455,"isVerified":false,"mediaCount":1727,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/fededomin","automatedBy":null,"canMediaTag":false,"description":"","isAutomated":false,"profile_bio":{"entities":{"url":{"urls":[{"url":"https://t.co/8f27G1xF6h","indices":[0,23],"display_url":"instagram.com/_fededomin_?ig…","expanded_url":"https://www.instagram.com/_fededomin_?igsh=MXV3MThtanpja2x3Yg%3D%3D&utm_source=qr"}]},"description":{}},"description":"Autor de “La Rebelión de los Pandemials”, “Argentina Hiperacelerada” y “Volver a Ser Grandes” Magister en finanzas UTDT/Liberal 📚 🌎 🇦🇷"},"coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/148579545/1733847505","isTranslator":false,"verifiedType":null,"statusesCount":17068,"isBlueVerified":true,"pinnedTweetIds":["2059098947428245505"],"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1787664112018665475/tovTMLmX_normal.jpg","favouritesCount":97406,"possiblySensitive":false,"fastFollowersCount":0,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{}},"source":"Twitter for iPhone","article":null,"isReply":false,"entities":{"urls":[],"symbols":[],"hashtags":[],"timestamps":[],"user_mentions":[{"name":"Econométrica","id_str":"199492223","indices":[674,687],"screen_name":"Econometrica"}]},"createdAt":"Fri Sep 04 19:30:26 +0000 2026","likeCount":182,"viewCount":7070,"quoteCount":4,"replyCount":4,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/fededomin/statu