{"id":"2103517777189343233","url":"https://x.com/DespegueArg/status/2103517777189343233","card":null,"lang":"es","text":"Que la inversión grande tenga que cerrar la energía de antemano es una buena noticia para quien provee y construye.

Data centers y minería no arrancan sin potencia firme. En el RIGI completo — unos USD 209.246 millones en 47 proyectos, 23 ya con resolución — eso se traduce en generación, redes y servicios. Por eso armamos el mapa proyecto por proyecto: qué se compra en cada etapa y qué oficio aparece.

Si el industrial lo ve temprano, entra cuando todavía se está armando la lista.","type":"tweet","place":{},"author":{"id":"2077395043816448000","url":"https://x.com/DespegueArg","name":"Ignacio Aredez - Despegue","type":"user","canDm":true,"status":"","entities":{"url":{},"description":{"urls":[]}},"location":"Argentina · desde Alemania","userName":"DespegueArg","createdAt":"Wed Jul 15 14:09:09 +0000 2026","followers":40,"following":155,"isVerified":false,"mediaCount":20,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/DespegueArg","automatedBy":null,"canMediaTag":true,"description":"","isAutomated":false,"profile_bio":{"entities":{"url":{"urls":[{"url":"https://t.co/2hDtgLMYFr","indices":[0,23],"display_url":"despegueargentina.com","expanded_url":"http://despegueargentina.com"}]},"description":{}},"description":"Dónde entrar a la inversión que llega: los proyectos RIGI, quién compra, qué y cuándo. Cada cifra con su fuente primaria. Creemos en el rumbo."},"coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2077395043816448000/1784274584","isTranslator":false,"verifiedType":null,"statusesCount":412,"isBlueVerified":true,"pinnedTweetIds":["2103122699598086374"],"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2077403412983943168/tNT0JxPC_normal.jpg","favouritesCount":349,"possiblySensitive":false,"fastFollowersCount":0,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{}},"source":"Twitter for iPhone","article":null,"isReply":true,"entities":{"urls":[],"symbols":[],"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"user_mentions":[]},"createdAt":"Fri Sep 25 16:11:34 +0000 2026","likeCount":0,"viewCount":5,"quoteCount":0,"replyCount":0,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/DespegueArg/status/2103517777189343233","inReplyToId":"2103487248293380126","quoted_tweet":null,"retweetCount":0,"bookmarkCount":0,"conversationId":"2103487248293380126","inReplyToUserId":null,"retweeted_tweet":null,"displayTextRange":[17,294],"extendedEntities":{},"inReplyToUsername":null}

