{"id":"2107531638246621539","url":"https://x.com/ZocaloFinanzas/status/2107531638246621539","card":null,"lang":"es","text":"Claro y Oracle anunciaron una alianza para construir en Argentina el primer centro de datos de nube pública a hiperescala, es decir, infraestructura con capacidad para procesar y almacenar grandes volúmenes de información a gran velocidad.

La clave del proyecto es la "soberanía de datos": que la información de empresas y usuarios argentinos se guarde y procese dentro del país, sin depender de servidores en el exterior.

Además, la inversión sumará más de 200 herramientas de inteligencia artificial disponibles para el empresariado local, con el objetivo de mejorar su competitividad frente a mercados globales 📈","type":"tweet","place":{},"author":{"id":"1963671340780490752","url":"https://x.com/ZocaloFinanzas","name":"ZocaloFinanzas","type":"user","canDm":false,"status":"","entities":{"url":{},"description":{"urls":[]}},"location":"","userName":"ZocaloFinanzas","createdAt":"Thu Sep 04 18:32:15 +0000 2025","followers":15,"following":28,"isVerified":false,"mediaCount":153,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/ZocaloFinanzas","automatedBy":null,"canMediaTag":true,"description":"","isAutomated":false,"profile_bio":{"entities":{"description":{}},"description":"Te cuento lo que pasa en los mercados (dólar, acciones, cripto) en criollo y sin vueltas. Actualizado todo el día 📊 | Fuentes citadas en cada post"},"coverPicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1963671340780490752/1788387451","isTranslator":false,"verifiedType":null,"statusesCount":586,"isBlueVerified":true,"pinnedTweetIds":["1963718008586883150"],"profilePicture":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2095979470960082946/UK49MOWr_normal.jpg","favouritesCount":72,"possiblySensitive":false,"fastFollowersCount":0,"hasCustomTimelines":true,"withheldInCountries":[],"affiliatesHighlightedLabel":{}},"source":"Twitter for iPhone","article":null,"isReply":false,"entities":{"urls":[],"symbols":[],"hashtags":[],"user_mentions":[]},"createdAt":"Tue Oct 06 18:01:13 +0000 2026","likeCount":0,"viewCount":1,"quoteCount":0,"replyCount":0,"twitterUrl":"https://twitter.com/ZocaloFinanzas/status/2107531638246621539","inReplyToId":null,"quoted_tweet":null,"retweetCount":0,"bookmarkCount":0,"communityInfo":null,"conversationId":"2107531638246621539","isLimitedReply":false,"inReplyToUserId":null,"retweeted_tweet":null,"displayTextRange":[0,279],"extendedEntities":{},"inReplyToUsername":null}

